            <ArticleTitle>Two cases of giant aneurysm in coronary-pulmonary artery fistula associated with atherosclerotic change.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>577-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Giant sacclar aneurysm in a coronary-pulmonary artery fistula is extremely rare. In this article, we presented two cases of giant aneurysms in coronary-pulmonary artery fistula with atherosclerosis.</AbstractText>
